DESCRIPTION:An immersive comedy show about Milton Keynes Shopping Centre? O
 h\, go on then. So You Think You're Funny? 2024 semi-finalist and interior 
 designer Michael McPheat presents a WIP masterpiece celebrating the beauty 
 of his hometown. A high-energy spectacle confronting mortality\, memory and
  modernism\, set in the utopian town of the future\, now named 'One of the 
 worst places to live in Britain.' Developed with Soho Theatre Labs Plus and
  Elf Lyons. 'We feel McPheat's sincerity in everything he says\, and it onl
 y makes his jokes all the funnier' **** (PepperAndSalt.uk).\nMore info: htt
 ps://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/michael-mcpheat-is-brutal/
